    {
      "id": "pFGibm7LyefWQPNKdrvUS",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1091.5,
      "y": -1277,
      "width": 400,
      "height": 607.5,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#111",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [
        "oUNGUK0B3bvgV0ZdzTF53"
      ],
      "frameId": null,
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1987010467,
      "version": 8,
      "versionNonce": 694123843,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1782936807630,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "源码依据\n\ninternal/runtime/maps/map.go\ninternal/runtime/maps/table.go\ninternal/runtime/maps/group.go\nabi.MapGroupSlots = 8\nmaxAvgGroupLoad = 7          // load 7/8\nmaxTableCapacity = 1024      // 单表上限\n\nh1(h uintptr) uintptr {\n    return h >> 7\n}\n\nh2(h uintptr) uintptr {\n    return h & 0x7f\n}\n\nGo map 实现基于 Abseil Swiss Table 思想\nGroup = 8 slots + control word\nH1 = hash 高 57 bit\nH2 = hash 低 7 bit\ncontrol byte 使用 7 bit 存储 H2\nlookup 先 H2 并行匹配，再 key equality\nprobing 使用 quadratic probing\ndirectory 使用 globalDepth/globalShift 选择 table\nsmall map 时 dirPtr 直接指向 single group\ngrowthLeft==0 触发 rehash；2×cap≤1024 则 grow，否则 split",
      "fontSize": 18,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "containerId": "P-usRFu8kqxlpM9GCJ46q",
      "originalText": "源码依据\n\ninternal/runtime/maps/map.go\ninternal/runtime/maps/table.go\ninternal/runtime/maps/group.go\nabi.MapGroupSlots = 8\nmaxAvgGroupLoad = 7          // load 7/8\nmaxTableCapacity = 1024      // 单表上限\n\nh1(h uintptr) uintptr {\n    return h >> 7\n}\n\nh2(h uintptr) uintptr {\n    return h & 0x7f\n}\n\nGo map 实现基于 Abseil Swiss Table 思想\nGroup = 8 slots + control word\nH1 = hash 高 57 bit\nH2 = hash 低 7 bit\ncontrol byte 使用 7 bit 存储 H2\nlookup 先 H2 并行匹配，再 key equality\nprobing 使用 quadratic probing\ndirectory 使用 globalDepth/globalShift 选择 table\nsmall map 时 dirPtr 直接指向 single group\ngrowthLeft==0 触发 rehash；2×cap≤1024 则 grow，否则 split",
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "index": "a6",
      "autoResize": true
    },
