      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Small Map 优化\n\nused <= abi.MapGroupSlots 时：\ndirPtr 直接指向 single group\ndirLen = 0\n不需要 directory\n最多一个 group\n\n小 map 查询时直接扫描 single group\n超过 small map 容量后再转为 directory/table 结构",
