      "originalText": "split 结论\n\nmaxTableCapacity = 1024\n2×cap>1024 时 split 成两表\n两表各 capacity=1024，localDepth+1\n按 H1 更高位分流 key\nlocalDepth==globalDepth 时扩 directory\ndirLen×2；globalDepth++；globalShift--",
