      "versionNonce": 1128863901,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1783895109298,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "• Go 1.26 sync.Map wraps internal/sync.HashTrieMap[any,any]\n• key/value 存在 entry.key 和 entry.value\n• indirect.children 是 16 槽 atomic pointer 数组\n• 每层使用 hash 的 4 bit 选择 child index\n• 禁止画旧版 read / dirty / misses / amended",
      "fontSize": 17,
      "fontFamily": 6,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "• Go 1.26 sync.Map wraps internal/sync.HashTrieMap[any,any]\n• key/value 存在 entry.key 和 entry.value\n• indirect.children 是 16 槽 atomic pointer 数组\n• 每层使用 hash 的 4 bit 选择 child index\n• 禁止画旧版 read / dirty / misses / amended",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.35,
      "index": "b65"
    },
