      "seed": 1011666948,
      "versionNonce": 1237589119,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "关键阈值（internal/runtime/maps）\n\nmaxAvgGroupLoad = 7        // load 7/8\nmaxTableCapacity = 1024    // 单表上限\nMapGroupSlots = 8\n\ngrowthLeft == 0\n  → 先 prune（tombstone ≥ 10%）\n  → 仍为 0 → rehash\n      2×cap ≤ 1024 → grow\n      否则 → split\n\nmaxGrowthLeft:\n  cap ≤ 8 : cap - 1\n  否则    : (cap × 7) / 8",
      "fontSize": 15,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": "7FgoFszbXtLCI8dZ5g6AT",
      "originalText": "关键阈值（internal/runtime/maps）\n\nmaxAvgGroupLoad = 7        // load 7/8\nmaxTableCapacity = 1024    // 单表上限\nMapGroupSlots = 8\n\ngrowthLeft == 0\n  → 先 prune（tombstone ≥ 10%）\n  → 仍为 0 → rehash\n      2×cap ≤ 1024 → grow\n      否则 → split\n\nmaxGrowthLeft:\n  cap ≤ 8 : cap - 1\n  否则    : (cap × 7) / 8",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    }
  ],
